WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.400
I found it! Over there!

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.900
Hoi! Joso!

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:05.690
Ketsu!

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:08.870
What were you thinking?!

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:12.100
You'll need extra lives if
you keep fighting like that...

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:14.970
Yoshi, you've got to stay quick
during a challenge!

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:17.740
Hey Tokine, are you okay?

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:22.840
High school student Yukimura Tokine and
junior high student Sumimura Yoshimori

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:24.180
are ordinary students by day.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:29.150
But at night, their mission is to
protect the Karasumori Site,

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:31.390
where the school now stands.
From the Ayakashi.

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:35.220
I will become stronger!

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:39.130
I never want to see her hurt again!

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:59.760
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:01.620
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:06.830
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:08.730
(Fighting late into the night)

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:12.170
Drive away all hesitation

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:16.570
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:20.110
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:20.110 --> 00:01:23.450
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:29.110
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:33.620
Sha la la la la...

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:40.030
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:42.000
(Secret romance)

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:47.200
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.970
(A strange distance)

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:55.810
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:56.880
Yeah

00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:00.350
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:04.120
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:09.280
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:50.760
We only have this demon left.

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:53.400
If you can't choose this one then...

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:55.700
Go!

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:03.840
I'll give you a name.

00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:07.140
You're my demon
so now you're called Yoki!

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:10.710
Yoki. Good name.

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:16.290
But I'm slow...
and I'm not so smart.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:17.820
I wanted to choose you Yoki!

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:22.500
You're my demon and
you're good and strong!

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:25.730
Okay.

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:28.260
That's why I'll give you this.

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:33.200
This is the pledge ring. Are you sure?

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:36.840
Once you put it on
you'll be mine Yoki.

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:39.170
And I will be yours.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:56.460
Now we'll always be together.

00:03:57.570 --> 00:04:01.940
Always together... with Yomi.

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:26.290
Hoi! Joso!

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:28.890
M-My back?!

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:38.060
Metsu!

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:42.500
Yoshimori!

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:46.410
- Ow! Ow! Ow!
- Are you all right, Yoki?!

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:50.610
Take back what you said
about him being worthless.

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:51.880
What's with you?

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:54.050
Take back what you said about
Tokine's dad dying in vain!

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:56.220
You don't know anything!

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:57.820
Maybe I don't.

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:04.020
But I do know that her dad died
to protect the ones he loved.

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:07.330
There's no way his death was in vain.

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:14.510
I thought I used plenty of drugs
on him.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:18.270
There's no way he could
wake up so quickly.

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:23.910
I suppose this brat was chosen
by this land after all!

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:27.850
Apologize to her.

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:31.150
Take your demon and get out of here.

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:35.220
You're right. I was wrong.

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:39.000
It seems you are going
to hinder me.

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:46.840
Whoa! What was that?!

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:52.880
T-Tokine!

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:57.610
You really should assess the situation
before you jump in.

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:00.950
Tokine, are you all right?!
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:02.150
I'm fine.

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:05.220
Really? Great.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:09.160
What about you?

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:14.290
I was just tied up
when you were fighting.

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:15.960
Oh.

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:22.000
I used too much of my power.
I can't fight normally anymore.

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:27.380
All right, Tokine!
So what do I have to do?

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:29.510
You got a plan, don't you?

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:35.490
Listen. The demon seems to be
following orders given by Yomi.

00:06:36.090 --> 00:06:38.180
I need you to distract the demon.

00:06:38.730 --> 00:06:41.390
I'll catch her while
you keep him busy.

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:42.420
Okay!

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:45.070
Yoki, can you move?

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:47.600
Y-Yeah.

00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:54.070
Amazing.

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:01.010
His regeneration abilities
are much better.

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:06.310
We can do this!
The Karasumori Site is on our side!

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:09.650
You already regenerated?

00:07:10.230 --> 00:07:12.190
I guess you wouldn't be
a worthy opponent otherwise.

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:14.160
Hmph. You brat! Yoki!

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:21.200
His tail is fast but as long as
the base stays in one spot

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:22.600
it's easy to read its movements.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:28.230
Hoi! Joso! Ketsu! Metsu!

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:41.080
He's regenerating too fast!
But he's too big to engulf entirely!

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:42.280
In that case!

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.290
I'll make him lose his balance!

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:45.350
Metsu!

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:55.970
Ow.

00:07:58.440 --> 00:08:03.610
Don't move. Order that demon
to get out of this place.

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:06.910
- And if I refuse?
- Yomi... Yomi...

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:13.140
Well... though it's not my style,
I'll use you as a hostage.

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:20.950
Yomi...

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:23.020
How did it find out where we are?!

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:29.860
You fool.

00:08:30.140 --> 00:08:33.570
Demon tamers can communicate
with their demons without speaking.

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:37.210
Cut it out!
Hurry up and get him out of here!

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:40.310
This isn't a place you can handle!

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:44.720
You'll never understand.

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:49.050
You were born with those powers!

00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:51.060
You are one of the chosen!

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:56.400
It's not your fault.

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:59.560
You just chose the wrong demon.

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:03.430
No no. Having any demon is
better than having none.

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:04.730
Don't you think so?

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:06.800
Poor thing...

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:09.840
You're not much of a Caster
to begin with.

00:09:10.050 --> 00:09:11.640
You should have chosen better.

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:14.470
My child embarrasses me.

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:17.980
I do not know how
I can face my kinsmen.

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:22.650
Father... I shall make Yoki stronger.

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:25.180
No matter how much you try

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:27.690
that demon cannot become greater
than what it was born with!

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:30.060
It shall be cast away one day!

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:38.000
It's not your fault Yomi.
It's because Yoki is weak...

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:43.610
Yoki will try to be stronger.
Please don't cry...

00:09:45.010 --> 00:09:46.670
Yomi-chan it'll be all right.

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:48.640
I'm sure Yoki can become stronger.

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:52.110
Look at me. I'm trying hard too.

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:53.980
You should do the same.

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:57.050
Kindness from adults are just lies!

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:59.360
I will never trust anyone again!

00:10:01.230 --> 00:10:06.130
Yoki! You will become stronger
here in the Karasumori Site.

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:10.070
Much... stronger...

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:18.330
He grew more tails!

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:21.880
He's evolving too fast!

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:25.950
I know! This body! Too big!

00:10:25.990 --> 00:10:27.610
That's why I can't move fast!

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:29.150
Trim away the waste!

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:30.710
Strong!

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:32.080
Stronger!

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:34.620
Stronger! Faster!

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:37.230
Amazing!

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:38.630
You're amazing, Yoki!

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:41.990
It hurts. It hurts.

00:10:42.270 --> 00:10:45.210
Can't change... why...

00:10:46.470 --> 00:10:50.540
I know. It's because I'm tied down.

00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:52.840
Someone is restricting me.

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:56.340
I don't need you anymore!

00:11:05.590 --> 00:11:08.080
Yoki... why?

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:18.640
He's a completely different being now.

00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:21.840
He can't hear your voice anymore.

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:39.260
It seems things have taken
a turn for the worse.

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:40.880
I'm terribly sorry.

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:44.830
It took too long finding out
what that girl was up to!

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:48.570
No, we're responsible for
what happens to our territory.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:50.630
Wait! Wait! Wait!

00:11:51.170 --> 00:11:53.870
Sumimura! What business do
you have, you geezer?!

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:57.270
I can't just sit and wait while
the Karasumori Site is in danger!

00:12:09.590 --> 00:12:10.990
Take care of her.

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:11.790
Sure.

00:12:15.260 --> 00:12:18.930
Don't interfere!
Don't get in his way!

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:24.470
I'm sorry, but I can't do that.

00:12:25.270 --> 00:12:27.680
But I won't kill him...

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:31.010
Since you say that demon
is important to you.

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:40.650
He's stupid, isn't he?
But he's being dead serious.

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:42.750
Spare me your sympathy!

00:12:43.060 --> 00:12:44.550
I have no sympathy for you.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:49.220
I still think we should kill off
that demon.

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:52.660
But that's just how he is.

00:12:53.840 --> 00:12:57.030
Heh! Looks like you went on a diet!

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:58.570
Now I can engulf you whole.

00:12:58.910 --> 00:12:59.570
Hoi!

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.070
Joso! Ketsu!

00:13:07.780 --> 00:13:09.340
This is magnificent!

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:14.510
He's fast!

00:13:20.760 --> 00:13:22.750
What is that demon doing?

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:37.940
Is he trying to destroy the school?

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:45.550
Just magnificent! Is this really me?!

00:13:45.990 --> 00:13:47.390
Are these powers truly mine?!

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.490
I would like to confirm one thing.

00:13:55.860 --> 00:13:59.600
Are you the guardian of this land?
The so-called Kekkaishi?

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:00.860
Yeah. What about it?

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:04.230
This land is terrific!

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:06.610
I am even provided with an opponent

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:07.900
to test my newfound powers.

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:11.000
Is that Yoki?
Is that really Yoki?

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:18.310
That's amazing Yoki!

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.920
Use the Enchanted Rock!

00:14:40.610 --> 00:14:41.770
Oh crap!

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:44.270
This is not interesting in the least.

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:47.680
Only the weak resort to
petty tricks like this.

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:49.380
Isn't that right, Yomi?

00:14:53.150 --> 00:14:57.350
That's right Yoki.
You have become strong enough.

00:14:57.390 --> 00:14:59.020
You don't need me anymore!

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:03.490
I can win against this petty human
without resorting to petty tricks.

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:05.320
Oh really?

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:09.230
You still haven't broken my Kekkai
with your own strength!

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:13.240
Go ahead and try with those powers!

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:15.070
Very well.

00:15:19.910 --> 00:15:21.970
His speed is abnormal!

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:24.940
If I'm going to engulf him...
I have to do it now!

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:27.720
Hoi! Joso!
Ketsu! Kai!

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:32.150
Stay still.

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:34.430
One wrong move and
your head might roll.

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:38.390
Now, get out of this land.

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:41.270
Your acts of pity are meaningless!

00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:47.330
Do you really think I cannot tear
through this puny Kekkai, boy?!

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:48.640
Oh hey!

00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:50.370
Karasumori Site!

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:52.640
Give me more strength!

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:03.150
Whoa! He's going to
transform again?!

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:14.590
Whoa! He's going to
transform again?!

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:16.230
That's right!

00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:18.830
You will become stronger!
Stronger than anybody!

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:23.470
I will become stronger!
More! More!

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:28.440
He's so powerful!

00:16:32.390 --> 00:16:33.380
Moon Blade!

00:16:39.030 --> 00:16:39.690
Yoki!

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:48.230
Who are you people?

00:16:48.970 --> 00:16:51.630
I am Hakudo from
the Shadow Organization's Special Forces.

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:53.730
I am Ohdo from the same unit.

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:55.460
The Shadow Organization?

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:57.950
By the order of
the Shadow Organization,

00:16:57.950 --> 00:17:01.040
we have come to capture the traitor,
Kasuga Yomi.

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:02.980
Yoki.

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:09.950
It's still trying to regenerate. Ohdo!

00:17:15.560 --> 00:17:17.690
- Stop!
- Watch out. Yomi-san!

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:18.990
Huh?! Uh-oh!

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:20.520
No!

00:17:25.470 --> 00:17:30.040
Yoki!

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:35.210
Yo... mi...

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:39.580
Yo... ki...

00:17:48.300 --> 00:17:49.290
Tenketsu!

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:10.540
I'm sorry... It's all my fault...
I'm sorry...

00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:14.410
I'm sorry... Yoki...

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:17.850
I must apologize for all the trouble
we have caused.

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:20.460
Regarding her punishment,

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:23.360
the Organization will put her
on trial, internally.

00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:29.430
We should have found out
about this before you notified us...

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.440
I cannot apologize enough.

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:33.400
No, I only confirmed the matter
on my own

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:35.070
because something bothered me.

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:39.670
If no problems occur,
I will not pursue it any further.

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:44.210
It seems that our superiors have
some plans for this land.

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:47.350
It is true that this place is dangerous,

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:50.410
but it is very interesting as well.

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:53.460
Allow me to warn you that

00:18:53.490 --> 00:18:56.090
even the executives of
the Shadow Organization

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:57.460
are not allowed to defile this land.

00:18:57.500 --> 00:19:01.160
If that were to occur.
We would stop you at all costs.

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:03.060
You need not worry about it.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:05.400
We will come another time
bearing gifts.

00:19:05.970 --> 00:19:08.500
Now if you'll excuse us. Let's go.

00:19:10.510 --> 00:19:12.500
Oh yes, Yoshimori-dono.

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:15.620
Your older brother asked me to
give you his best regards.

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:16.740
What?!

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:22.150
Yomi-san... You did all of this
just for that demon?

00:19:24.860 --> 00:19:27.560
You know how I said
I hated your father?

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:30.130
That wasn't a lie.

00:19:32.070 --> 00:19:35.800
He was weak, but he fought for
the ones he loved.

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:39.310
But in the end. He was still a loser.

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:42.340
I don't think he is a loser.

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:45.140
I am thankful for my father.

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:47.480
He fought for us until
the very last moment.

00:19:50.380 --> 00:19:51.040
I see.

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:56.250
Hey... I'm not supposed to keep
these things behind, but...

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:01.780
Yoki...

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:09.630
Is this revenge?

00:20:09.740 --> 00:20:10.400
Huh?

00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:16.540
You told me not to speak
of Tokine-san's father

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:18.640
because it'll make her remember
the sad things.

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:20.840
So now you're telling me
to relive those painful moments

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:21.940
by looking at this?!

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:23.610
I don't need this!

00:20:31.990 --> 00:20:33.480
Hey... It just...

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:42.090
Oh, wow! It's so tiny,
but it regenerated already.

00:20:43.070 --> 00:20:46.730
Oh. But it doesn't have
any kind of power

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:49.210
and I doubt it can gain any.

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:51.240
Yo... mi...

00:20:52.780 --> 00:20:56.220
Yo... mi... Yo... mi...

00:20:59.620 --> 00:21:00.640
Yoki...

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:04.480
I'm sorry... Tokine-san...

00:21:06.760 --> 00:21:12.500
I think I finally understand what
your father tried to protect.

00:21:15.470 --> 00:21:19.800
Your belongings are hidden near
the riverbank outside the back gate.

00:21:20.370 --> 00:21:22.170
Go and look for it later.

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:35.010
Yoshimori.

00:21:35.990 --> 00:21:38.420
Thank you for today.
You really saved me back there.

00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:50.560
All right. Let's clean up.

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:55.470
Chop, chop! Hurry up now!

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:02.310
There we go!

00:22:03.150 --> 00:22:04.550
Work harder!

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:11.880
However I will commend you for fighting
against that powerful Ayakashi.

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:13.050
Hey.

00:22:13.490 --> 00:22:14.480
What?!

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:17.460
That guy from the Shadow Organization
relayed a message

00:22:17.500 --> 00:22:19.690
from my brother sending his regards.

00:22:20.370 --> 00:22:22.100
What was he talking about?

00:22:22.640 --> 00:22:23.830
It's Masamori.

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:24.660
Huh?

00:22:24.810 --> 00:22:27.500
Masamori is in
the Shadow Organization.

00:22:29.240 --> 00:22:32.270
What is the Shadow Organization?

00:22:38.190 --> 00:22:45.890
The breeze blows past us
in this city we know so well

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:52.590
The two of us both walk at our usual pace

00:22:54.170 --> 00:23:01.980
Joking around I noticed after I laughed

00:23:01.980 --> 00:23:08.310
Your mature look that
I had never seen before

00:23:10.250 --> 00:23:18.160
You don't have to say anything it's okay

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:24.520
I'm not mistaking these feelings

00:23:26.100 --> 00:23:33.610
Straight ahead I'm pushing forward

00:23:33.610 --> 00:23:41.140
Yet I can't help but keep gazing at you

00:23:42.880 --> 00:23:50.120
Even if we are near or far

00:23:50.120 --> 00:23:58.690
The red string connects one to another
